709
00:37:34,485 --> 00:37:38,096
We're talking about cancer,
Alzheimer's, autoimmune.

710
00:37:38,231 --> 00:37:39,988
We will be saving lives, but...

711
00:37:40,123 --> 00:37:41,664
- I bet.
