00:38:03,588 --> 00:38:05,550
So, uh, I want to do
more of this,

721
00:38:05,686 --> 00:38:07,785
um, later on if we, um...

722
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:09,853
Oh, we booked you a private pod

723
00:38:09,988 --> 00:38:11,558
- for the trip out, so...
